title: "Post PIV Analysis Tools for Moving Airfoil"
date-released: 2026-08-27
abstract: |
  This repository contains MATLAB scripts for post‑processing PIV velocity fields obtained
  using PIVlab for a moving airfoil. The image frame/space is fixed while the airfoil moves
  through the camera frames along a circular arc. The code determines velocity fields
  relative to the airfoil's trailing edge.

repository-code: "https://github.com/rakshithajoshi/Post-PIV-Analysis-Tools-for-Moving-Airfoil"
